    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-temporal.zoneddatetime.prototype.gettimezonetransition\ndescription: >\n  Named time zones that no longer observe DST return null for the \"next\"\n  direction when queried from a date after their last transition.\ninfo: |\n  Some time zones historically observed DST but no longer do. When queried for\n  \"next\" from a date after the last historical transition, the result should be\n  null. When queried for \"previous\", it should find the last historical\n  transition.\nfeatures: [Temporal]\n---",
      "start": 128,
      "end": 632
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Asia/Kolkata has not observed DST since 1945.",
      "start": 634,
      "end": 682
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Querying from 2024 should find no next transition but should find a previous one.",
      "start": 683,
      "end": 767
    }
  ]
